    UseMotorSensorKey: 1
    motorSensorKey: 3
    displayTexts:
    - 'You say your pleasantries to the men on the right wall, waiting their turn
      for the graveyard. They are solemn and stone-cold in your presence. One of
      them introduces himself. He explained they were the Uncounted, those disgarded
      from the hand of Spawns. '
    - '"We refuse to play this game. Refuse to reduce our stories to a pure number
      only to be reborn and do it again. You''ve only just come out of the chamber.
      You wouldn''t understand. You probably still don''t know how to use your body
      of yours."'
